      "related_domains": "Technical"
    },
    {
      "type": "Technical",
      "requirement": "If an HVDC transmission system is used, then in addition to OSPs there may be one or more AC/DC Convertor Offshore Platforms within the wind farm development area, necessitating additional inter-platform transmission AC cabling.",
